@startuml
title Inline Edit and Immutable Versioning
actor User
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Teaching Output API" as API
participant "Generated Output Service" as Service
database PostgreSQL as DB
User -> UI: Edit current output
UI -> API: POST /versions (content, reason)
API -> Service: authorise outputs.edit
Service -> DB: lock output and read current version
Service -> DB: append new output_version
Service -> DB: set current_version_id
Service -> DB: append safety review + workflow action
Service --> UI: current version N+1
User -> UI: Restore version 1
UI -> API: POST /versions/{id}/restore
API -> Service: copy old content into version N+2
Service --> UI: restored content, old history retained
@enduml
